Scoped colorcorrect video filter

The option table (rl, bl, rh, bh, saturation, analyze and its constants),
pixel_fmts, config_input's depth-8 constants (max, imax, chroma steps and plane
sizes), the minmax_slice8 and median_8 analyses and their combination in
filter_frame, and the per-pixel colorcorrect_slice8 arithmetic (PROCESS and the
av_clip_uint8 store) in src/video-ops/colorcorrect.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_colorcorrect.c (colorcorrect_options, pixel_fmts, config_input,
filter_frame, minmax_slice8, median_8, colorcorrect_slice8).
